    "program_source": "def transform(grid):\n    out=[row[:] for row in grid]\n    pts=[(r,c) for r,row in enumerate(grid) for c,v in enumerate(row) if v==2]\n    if not pts:return out\n    r0=min(r for r,c in pts);r1=max(r for r,c in pts)\n    c0=min(c for r,c in pts);c1=max(c for r,c in pts)\n    for r,row in enumerate(grid):\n        for c,v in enumerate(row):\n            if v==8 and not (r0<=r<=r1 and c0<=c<=c1):out[r][c]=0\n    return out",
